  {
    "id": "script_1754299626235_cu9isgqy5",
    "title": "The Secret of the Cheese Feast",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "The annual 'Cheese Feast' is the most important festival in Cheese Town, and also the key to the mayoral election. This year's feast not only features a dazzling array of cheeses, but also a 'cheese-eating contest' that will decide the mayor. However, on the eve of the competition, someone anonymously reports that this year's cheese has been adulterated with banned ingredients in an attempt to manipulate the competition results. The contestants are fighting openly and secretly, and the conspiracy behind it is gradually emerging. Who is the real mastermind? And who can have the last laugh at this cheese feast?",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "monty",
        "name": "Monty Gouda",
        "identity": "Veteran cheese lover, mayoral candidate",
        "personality": "Scheming, ambitious, outwardly friendly",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "camembert",
        "name": "Camembert Brie",
        "identity": "New cheese expert, mayoral candidate",
        "personality": "Confident and decisive, sharp, pursues fairness",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "gorgonzola",
        "name": "Gorgonzola Roquefort",
        "identity": "Old cheese merchant, competition sponsor",
        "personality": "Profit-oriented, opportunistic, well-informed",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "parmesan",
        "name": "Parma Reggiano",
        "identity": "Competition host, the town's good old boy",
        "personality": "Fair and strict, helpful, but a bit slow",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins, the first round is the 'Wheel of Cheese Challenge.' Monty takes the lead, showing an amazing appetite. Camembert follows closely, but seems to be struggling a bit. Gorgonzola is in the audience, frequently talking to different people with a complex expression. Parma hosts the competition dutifully, announcing the rules.",
        "privateClues": {
          "monty": "I saw Gorgonzola secretly talking to Parma before the competition, seeming to imply that Parma should favor me. If I am elected mayor, he will get more benefits.",
          "camembert": "I tasted that today's cheese is a bit off, it seems to have some kind of emetic added, which caused my appetite to decrease. I suspect Monty is behind it, he knows I'm young and wants to defeat me with dirty tricks."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "The second round is the 'Goat Cheese Platter.' Camembert adjusts his state and catches up, neck and neck with Monty. However, someone suddenly faints during the competition, causing chaos. Parma quickly organizes medical staff for treatment, and Gorgonzola disappears in the chaos.",
        "privateClues": {
          "monty": "The person who fainted is a supporter of Camembert. I had previously heard people discussing their opposition to me adding 'special' spices to the cheese. It seems someone doesn't want me to win, I must take action.",
          "camembert": "I noticed that Gorgonzola seems to be secretly observing me, his eyes full of inquiry. I previously found out that his cheese workshop cuts corners. If I am elected mayor, I will definitely investigate his workshop thoroughly."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The third and final round is 'Blue Cheese Speed Eating.' The scene becomes heated, with both Monty and Camembert giving it their all. Parma announces that the competition is in its final countdown. Suddenly, someone reveals that Monty's cheese was indeed adulterated with banned ingredients, and the evidence is conclusive. In the end, Camembert wins the competition and is successfully elected mayor.",
        "privateClues": {
          "monty": "Someone reported me! It must be Camembert! I must find a way to clear my name, or my reputation will be ruined. I saw Gorgonzola whispering to Camembert just now, he must be the one pulling the strings!",
          "camembert": "I won! Justice will eventually prevail over evil! I know Gorgonzola has been helping me investigate Monty's violations, and the evidence he provided was crucial. I will reorganize Cheese Town so that everyone can eat healthy and delicious cheese!"
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754299626235,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754300000800_0qicwar45",
    "title": "The Secret of the Golden Apple",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "The small town of Edenburg, at the foot of the Alps, is famous for its delicious golden apples. Every autumn harvest season, the town holds a grand apple-eating contest, attracting foodies and apple lovers from all over. However, this year's competition is shrouded in a mysterious atmosphere. The town's old fruit farmer, Hans, claims to have cultivated a 'Golden Apple King' with magical powers. Whoever eats it will gain unexpected wealth and wisdom. As soon as the news broke, the whole town was in an uproar. But at the same time, some strange things have happened in the town: the statue of the apple orchard's guardian deity has been destroyed, and the Apple King seems to have mysteriously disappeared. This year's apple-eating contest is destined to be anything but peaceful.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "emma",
        "name": "Emma Brown",
        "identity": "Food critic",
        "personality": "Shrewd and capable, a perfectionist with a high appreciation for food, but sometimes too harsh.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "leo",
        "name": "Leo Baker",
        "identity": "Heir to the apple orchard",
        "personality": "Enthusiastic and cheerful, helpful, has a deep affection for the family's apple orchard, but sometimes too impulsive.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "hans",
        "name": "Hans Müller",
        "identity": "Old fruit farmer",
        "personality": "Old-fashioned and stubborn, experienced, loves apples deeply, and firmly believes in legends.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "gretel",
        "name": "Gretel Schmidt",
        "identity": "The town's baker",
        "personality": "Kind and friendly, skillful, good at making all kinds of apple desserts, likes to inquire about gossip.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "fritz",
        "name": "Fritz Wagner",
        "identity": "The town's tavern owner",
        "personality": "Taciturn, keeps his cards close to his chest, runs the only tavern in town, and seems to know many secrets.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins, and the contestants are tasting various flavors of golden apples. Emma carefully savors each apple, trying to find the legendary 'Golden Apple King.' Leo is busy greeting guests and introducing the characteristics of his family's apples. Hans is anxiously searching for something in the crowd, sighing from time to time. Gretel is busy selling her apple pies on the side and quietly inquiring about the 'Golden Apple King.' Fritz sits in the tavern, silently observing everything.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emma": "You notice that Hans has been staring at Leo with dissatisfaction in his eyes. You also see Gretel quietly taking something from Hans's pocket.",
          "leo": "You notice that Emma shows great interest in your family's apples, she seems to be looking for a special kind of apple. You also hear Hans muttering 'stolen' under his breath."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "The competition reaches its climax, and the contestants begin to compete on speed, to see who can eat the most apples. Although Emma eats elegantly, her speed is not slow, and she is still looking for the 'Golden Apple King.' Leo also joins the competition, wanting to prove the quality of his family's apples. Hans suddenly rushes onto the stage, accusing Leo of stealing the 'Golden Apple King.' Gretel fans the flames on the side, claiming that she saw Leo enter Hans's apple orchard with her own eyes. Fritz remains silent, just handing Hans a glass of wine.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emma": "You notice that what Gretel took is a key with the apple orchard's logo on it. You also notice that when Fritz handed Hans the wine, he seemed to whisper something in his ear.",
          "leo": "There is a hint of fear in Hans's eyes as he accuses you, not anger. You recall seeing a dark figure in the apple orchard last night, but you couldn't see who it was."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The scene is in chaos, and the police arrive to investigate the theft of the 'Golden Apple King.' Emma and Leo decide to team up to investigate and hope to find the truth. Hans insists that Leo is the thief and asks the police to arrest him. Gretel slips away in the chaos. Fritz finally speaks up, claiming that he knows the whereabouts of the 'Golden Apple King,' but someone has to pay a price to get this secret.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emma": "You find a small golden fragment in Gretel's apple pie, which seems to have fallen from some kind of apple. You also hear Fritz telling the police that he knows who entered Hans's apple orchard last night.",
          "leo": "You find a strange footprint in your own apple orchard, which doesn't look like a human's. You also notice that an apple tree is missing from Hans's apple orchard, and that tree seemed to bear a particularly large apple."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754300000800,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754300434135_k0q25gued",
    "title": "The Secret of the Banana Carnival Night",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "Welcome to the annual 'Banana Carnival Night'! On the tropical island of Mangu, this is a grand festival to celebrate the harvest and friendship. The most eye-catching event is the 'Banana Speed-Eating Contest.' This year, the prize is the 'Golden Banana,' which is said to bring unexpected good luck to its owner in the coming year. However, the atmosphere this year is a bit unusual. Last year's champion, the old sea captain Li Weisi, mysteriously disappeared before the competition, leaving behind a meaningful letter that said: 'Behind the banana, there are unknown secrets.' This year's competition is not only a contest of speed, but also a pursuit of the truth.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "character1",
        "name": "Emily Li",
        "identity": "Li Weisi's granddaughter, an independent journalist",
        "personality": "Smart, brave, with a strong sense of justice, determined to find out the truth about her grandfather's disappearance",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "character2",
        "name": "Morris",
        "identity": "The island's banana plantation owner",
        "personality": "Slick, shrewd, with an unusual desire for money",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character3",
        "name": "Kate",
        "identity": "The island's bar owner",
        "personality": "Enthusiastic, gossipy, well-informed",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character4",
        "name": "Jack",
        "identity": "An outside tourist, self-proclaimed food critic",
        "personality": "Mysterious, picky, with a special research interest in bananas",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins, and all contestants are desperately eating bananas. Emily competes while observing the people around her. She notices that Morris seems particularly nervous, while Jack is observing the quality of the bananas during the competition. Kate weaves through the crowd, seemingly cheering for the contestants, but actually quietly inquiring about something.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "In the envelope left by your grandfather, there is also a yellowed photo of a young Morris and your grandfather under an ancient banana tree deep in the island. The back of the photo says: 'A shared secret.'",
          "character2": "Before the competition, you saw Jack secretly sprinkling some strange powder on his bananas. You think he might be cheating, but he gives you a very dangerous feeling, which makes you afraid to speak up.",
          "character3": "I heard Morris and Jack talking in a low voice in the corner, mentioning 'the curse of the Golden Banana' and 'the way to lift the curse.' It seems the Golden Banana is not just a prize.",
          "character4": "The variety of these bananas is very special, and some of them seem to have been genetically modified. I need more samples for analysis to determine the purpose of the modification. I suspect this is related to the special soil on the island."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "During a break in the competition, Emily finds Kate and asks about Li Weisi's disappearance. Kate reveals that before his disappearance, Li Weisi seemed to have been investigating the secrets of the island's banana plantation. And Morris is the biggest beneficiary. Jack claims to be very interested in the origin of bananas and hopes to find the oldest banana variety.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "Kate told me that before his disappearance, my grandfather had discovered that Morris's plantation was using a large amount of illegal fertilizers, which could cause the bananas to mutate and even produce toxins.",
          "character2": "Someone told me that Li Weisi seems to have found evidence of your illegal use of fertilizers and plans to report you. If he discloses this information, your banana empire will be ruined.",
          "character3": "Jack gave me a sum of money to help him collect some special banana varieties. He said these bananas are very important for his research, but I always feel that he is hiding something.",
          "character4": "Through analysis, I found that these bananas contain trace amounts of radioactive elements. This means that the place where they grow may have some kind of radiation source. This explains the special taste and efficacy of the bananas."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The competition enters a heated stage. Emily realizes that to find the truth, she must win the competition and get the Golden Banana. She speeds up and surpasses the other contestants. At the last moment, Emily sees Jack secretly stuffing a banana into Morris's mouth, and Morris instantly falls to the ground. Emily realizes that this is not just a competition, but a carefully planned conspiracy.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "I saw that the banana Jack secretly stuffed into Morris's mouth had an unusual color, as if it had been specially treated. I must find evidence as soon as possible to expose his conspiracy and find out the truth about my grandfather's disappearance.",
          "character2": "Jack! Why did you do this! You promised to help me get rid of Li Weisi's threat, not kill me! I... I...",
          "character3": " (Scared) I... I don't know anything. Jack just asked me to help collect bananas, I really don't know about the other things... Please let me go...",
          "character4": "(Cold laugh) It seems that the secret of the Golden Banana is about to be revealed. That banana contains highly toxic radioactive material, which is the last step to lift the 'curse of the Golden Banana.' Now, it's my turn to get the Golden Banana."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754300434135,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754300694093_nt0h7cy3o",
    "title": "In the Cucumber Field: The Cucumber Championship",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "In the scorching summer, Qinghe Village welcomes its annual cucumber harvest season. To celebrate the harvest and to select the village's 'cucumber big eater,' the village chief has specially organized a grand cucumber-eating contest. The villagers are enthusiastic and have signed up to participate. However, on the eve of the competition, whispers spread through the village: some say that this year's competition cucumbers have been tampered with, while others say that the village chief's granddaughter and a mysterious merchant from another village seem to have an ulterior secret. This seemingly simple cucumber-eating contest seems to hide some unknown conspiracies...",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "xiaocui",
        "name": "Cuihua",
        "identity": "The granddaughter of the village chief of Qinghe Village, and one of the organizers of this competition",
        "personality": "Lively and cheerful, kind-hearted, but sometimes too willful, has a favorable impression of the mysterious merchant from another village, Boss Li.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "zhangsan",
        "name": "Zhang San",
        "identity": "A villager of Qinghe Village, a famous 'foodie' in the village, and a hot favorite to win this competition.",
        "personality": "Honest and simple, with an amazing appetite, has an extraordinary love for cucumbers, but is also a bit careless.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "lili",
        "name": "Li Li",
        "identity": "A villager of Qinghe Village, a volunteer for this competition, responsible for recording the competition results.",
        "personality": "Meticulous and serious, has a good grasp of all the big and small matters in the village, but is a bit gossipy.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "wangwu",
        "name": "Wang Wu",
        "identity": "A merchant from another village, claiming to want to buy the cucumbers of Qinghe Village",
        "personality": "Shrewd and slick, good with words, seems to have a special interest in the cucumbers of Qinghe Village, always gives a feeling of ill intentions.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "zhaoliu",
        "name": "Zhao Liu",
        "identity": "A villager of Qinghe Village, also a contestant, with average strength.",
        "personality": "Timid and afraid of trouble, goes with the flow, often echoes others in a crowd, has no opinion of his own.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins. Cuihua enthusiastically announces the rules, Zhang San is full of confidence, and Wang Wu smiles meaningfully on the side. The first round is fierce, Zhang San is far ahead, but just as he is about to finish the last cucumber, he suddenly turns pale, clutches his stomach, and seems to have eaten something unclean.",
        "privateClues": {
          "xiaocui": "Before the competition, Wang Wu secretly gave you a packet of powder, saying it could increase the sweetness of the cucumbers, and asked you to secretly add it to the cucumbers during the competition. But you were hesitant and didn't completely follow his instructions.",
          "zhangsan": "You find that the cucumber you ate seems a bit off, the taste is a bit bitter, and your stomach hurts faintly. You recall seeing Cuihua sneakily adding something to the cucumbers before the competition."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Zhang San withdraws from the competition, causing a commotion. Li Li hurries forward to ask about the situation, while Wang Wu takes the opportunity to approach Cuihua and talk to her in a low voice. Zhao Liu seems to have seen something, but dares not speak up. The second round ends hastily, and the atmosphere becomes tense.",
        "privateClues": {
          "xiaocui": "Wang Wu tells you that the powder must be fully added to be effective, and implies that if you don't do as he says, he will cancel the cucumber purchase plan with Qinghe Village. You feel very uneasy, but dare not disobey Wang Wu's wishes.",
          "zhangsan": "You carefully recall the taste of the cucumber and find that the bitter taste seems to be mixed with a faint almond smell. You remember the village legend about poisonous wild almonds."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "Cuihua announces the start of the third round, but the villagers' enthusiasm has waned. Zhang San suddenly rushes onto the stage, accusing Cuihua of poisoning the cucumbers and claiming to have evidence. Wang Wu tries to stop Zhang San, but it's too late. The truth is about to be revealed...",
        "privateClues": {
          "xiaocui": "You realize that you have been used by Wang Wu. He doesn't really want to buy the cucumbers, but has other purposes. You decide to stand up and expose Wang Wu's conspiracy, but find that you have no direct evidence.",
          "zhangsan": "You secretly picked up a piece of cucumber you had left on the ground and took it to the old Chinese doctor in the village for identification. The results showed that the cucumber did contain trace amounts of a toxic substance, which was the toxin of wild almonds."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754300694093,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754300962811_oz3v6vcw5",
    "title": "Watermelon Mystery",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "In the scorching summer, Huaihua Village holds its annual watermelon festival. The 'Jade' watermelon, carefully cultivated by the village chief, Old Man Wang, has won the love of the whole village with its sweet and juicy taste. However, on the eve of the watermelon festival, the priceless 'Jade' watermelon mysteriously disappears, leaving only an empty vine. Everyone suspects that someone has stolen the watermelon, wanting to enjoy this delicacy alone, or to secretly sabotage the watermelon festival. The participants must find the real culprit, uncover the truth behind the watermelon theft, and let the watermelon festival proceed smoothly.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "character1",
        "name": "Li Cuihua",
        "identity": "Old Man Wang's niece, a university student in town, who came back specially to help with the watermelon festival",
        "personality": "Lively and cheerful, curious, very concerned about the big and small matters in the village",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "character2",
        "name": "Zhang Dazhuang",
        "identity": "A strong laborer in the village, usually taciturn, but very strong",
        "personality": "Honest and simple, not good with words, very enthusiastic about village affairs",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character3",
        "name": "Aunt Zhao",
        "identity": "The village's famous gossip queen, well-informed, loves to pry into other people's private affairs",
        "personality": "Enthusiastic and cheerful, loves to join in the fun, but sometimes exaggerates",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character4",
        "name": "Sun Quezi",
        "identity": "An old bachelor in the village, with a lame leg, who usually makes a living by collecting scraps",
        "personality": "Solitary and indifferent, doesn't like to communicate with others, but has an amazing memory",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The news of the watermelon theft quickly spreads throughout the village, and the villagers are talking about it. Li Cuihua wants to find the watermelon as soon as possible. She first finds Zhang Dazhuang, who was the last to see the watermelon, to ask about the situation. At the same time, Aunt Zhao is also inquiring everywhere, wanting to get first-hand information. Sun Quezi is smoking alone at the village entrance, seemingly indifferent to all this.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "Last night, I saw Zhang Dazhuang walking suspiciously towards the melon shed, he seemed to be holding a sack. I thought it was strange, but I was too sleepy at the time and didn't think much of it.",
          "character2": "Last night, I helped Old Man Wang move the watermelon to the melon shed, it was really heavy. I saw Sun Quezi staring at us, his eyes were very strange.",
          "character3": "I heard that Sun Quezi has been short of money recently, it seems he has gambling debts. Could he have stolen the watermelon because he was short of money?",
          "character4": "Last night, I saw Aunt Zhao sneak into Old Man Wang's yard, I don't know what she wanted to do. She has always been very interested in Old Man Wang's things."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Li Cuihua finds Old Man Wang and learns that the 'Jade' watermelon is a new variety this year and is very valuable. She begins to suspect that someone in the village is coveting the value of this watermelon. Zhang Dazhuang actively finds Li Cuihua and says he saw Sun Quezi loitering near the melon shed. Aunt Zhao claims to have seen Sun Quezi steal a large watermelon from the melon shed with her own eyes. Sun Quezi flatly denies it, claiming to know nothing.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "Old Man Wang said that he was keeping this watermelon for the town's agricultural product exhibition. If it wins an award, it will bring great honor to the village. Aunt Zhao has always wanted her son to be the village chief. Could she have stolen the watermelon to prevent Old Man Wang from winning the award?",
          "character2": "I see Aunt Zhao often interacting with some outsiders. Could she have sold the watermelon to them?",
          "character3": "I went to Old Man Wang's house yesterday to deliver vegetables and saw Li Cuihua constantly asking about the watermelon, she seemed very anxious. Could she be trying to sell the watermelon and split the money herself?",
          "character4": "Last night I heard Zhang Dazhuang and Aunt Zhao arguing near the melon shed, it seemed to be about an uneven distribution of spoils. Did they steal the watermelon together?"
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "Li Cuihua carefully analyzes all the clues and finds that everyone is a suspect. She decides to gather everyone together for a confrontation. Zhang Dazhuang accuses Sun Quezi of stealing the watermelon, while Aunt Zhao accuses Zhang Dazhuang and Sun Quezi of conspiring together. Sun Quezi continues to deny it and bites back, saying he was framed. The truth is about to be revealed.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "I found that the lock on the melon shed was deliberately broken, and the technique was very professional. Zhang Dazhuang used to be a locksmith, he definitely has this ability.",
          "character2": "I did have a fight with Aunt Zhao yesterday, but that was because she slandered me for stealing the watermelon. I absolutely did not do such a thing.",
          "character3": "I did go to Old Man Wang's house yesterday, but that was because I wanted to persuade him not to work too hard. I absolutely did not steal the watermelon.",
          "character4": "Actually, I saw everything last night. It was Zhang Dazhuang and Aunt Zhao who stole the watermelon together. They gave me some benefits to help them cover up the truth. But now my conscience is uneasy, and I have decided to tell the truth."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754300962811,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754301001095_jejvnrtt9",
    "title": "Peach Orchard Mystery",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "As the sun sets, a gentle breeze blows through the peach orchard, bringing with it a sweet, fruity fragrance. You and your close friends, Li Qing and Zhao Ming, have been invited by the old village chief to participate in the annual Peach Orchard Festival. It is said that at the festival, the best quality peaches of the year are selected and offered to the Peach Orchard God. However, this year's festival is shrouded in a strange atmosphere. The old village chief looks grave, as if he has a premonition of something ominous. Sure enough, during the sacrificial ceremony, the 'King of Peaches,' which was supposed to be offered to the Peach Orchard God, disappears without a trace! What's even more shocking is that the person who discovered the theft of the King of Peaches has fallen into a coma, foaming at the mouth. Is it the wrath of the Peach Orchard God? Or is there another hidden story? You must find the King of Peaches and uncover the truth before the three rounds of sacrifices are over, otherwise, the entire village will suffer misfortune.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "liqing",
        "name": "Li Qing",
        "identity": "Wandering Taoist priest",
        "personality": "Calm and composed, good at observation, slightly mysterious",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "zhaoming",
        "name": "Zhao Ming",
        "identity": "A down-and-out scholar",
        "personality": "Meticulous, well-read, a bit timid",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "wanglaohan",
        "name": "Old Man Wang",
        "identity": "The old village chief of Peach Orchard Village",
        "personality": "Old and kind, attaches great importance to the Peach Orchard Festival, a bit stubborn",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "zhangsaozi",
        "name": "Sister-in-law Zhang",
        "identity": "A woman in the village, responsible for the preparation of the sacrifice",
        "personality": "Enthusiastic and cheerful, likes to gossip, well-informed",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The news of the King of Peaches' theft spreads quickly, and the village is in a panic. Old Man Wang insists that this is the Peach Orchard God's punishment for the village and demands that the King of Peaches be found and sacrificed as soon as possible. Sister-in-law Zhang is inquiring everywhere, claiming to have seen someone sneak into the peach orchard before the sacrifice.",
        "privateClues": {
          "liqing": "You notice a faint demonic aura remaining on the altar, not from divine power. The demonic aura points to the depths of the peach orchard, as if something is attracting it. An incense stick seems to be missing from the censer next to the altar.",
          "zhaoming": "You carefully observe the comatose person and find a special peach fragrance remaining in his mouth, which is slightly different from the fragrance of the King of Peaches. At the same time, you notice a delicately made sachet hanging from the village chief's waist, which seems to be newly made."
        },
        "npcClues": {
          "wanglaohan": "Some strange things have happened in the village recently. The crops in the fields have withered for no reason, and the well water has become turbid. I'm worried this is a warning from the Peach Orchard God.",
          "zhangsaozi": "Last night I seemed to see Old Man Wang going to the back mountain alone, I don't know what he was doing."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Old Man Wang insists on continuing the sacrifice and demands that the peach orchard be sealed off, prohibiting anyone from entering or leaving. Sister-in-law Zhang reveals that there is a legend in the village about a 'peach demon,' which is said to be a demon that lives deep in the peach orchard and absorbs the essence of the peach trees to cultivate.",
        "privateClues": {
          "liqing": "You go to the depths of the peach orchard and find a damaged peach tree with obvious claw marks on the trunk. The claw marks are new, as if made by some kind of beast. At the same time, you find a piece of cloth hanging on a branch, which seems to be torn from some kind of clothing.",
          "zhaoming": "You consult ancient books and find that the records about the peach demon are not groundless. The ancient books record that the peach demon likes to suck human essence, especially those with greedy hearts. You find that Sister-in-law Zhang's bracelet is very expensive, not something a village woman like her can afford."
        },
        "npcClues": {
          "wanglaohan": "We can't delay any longer, we must start the sacrifice immediately, or the Peach Orchard God will really punish us.",
          "zhangsaozi": "Oh, you can't talk nonsense about the peach demon, you'll be punished by the Peach Orchard God. However, I heard that when Old Man Wang was young, he once secretly picked a strange peach from the peach orchard, and his health has been poor ever since."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The sacrifice is about to begin, and Old Man Wang is determined to offer a villager as a sacrifice to the Peach Orchard God, claiming that only in this way can the god's anger be appeased. Sister-in-law Zhang secretly tells you that Old Man Wang seems to have a special obsession with the Peach Orchard Festival, even at the cost of others' lives.",
        "privateClues": {
          "liqing": "You find that the knife used by Old Man Wang for the sacrifice is engraved with strange runes, not Taoist talismans, but some kind of evil art. You speculate that Old Man Wang is not really going to make a sacrifice, but is using the sacrifice to achieve some ulterior motive. You recall the missing incense from the first round, which was engraved with similar runes.",
          "zhaoming": "You find a piece of disturbed soil next to the peach orchard altar. You dig up the soil and find an empty box buried inside, with the name 'King of Peaches' carved on it. The box is old, not recently placed. You realize that Old Man Wang has always known where the King of Peaches is, he never lost it."
        },
        "npcClues": {
          "wanglaohan": "This is for the village, for the peach orchard, sacrificing one person is worth it.",
          "zhangsaozi": "Old Man Wang is crazy! He must be crazy! We can't let him do this."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754301001095,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754301218318_bfad6mwn8",
    "title": "Water Source Mystery: The Secret of Nongfu Spring",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "By the Thousand Island Lake, the Nongfu Spring factory, famous for its high-quality water source, has recently been shrouded in a haze. The water quality inspection report shows unexplained fluctuations in water quality. Although the officials strongly deny pollution, the internal employees are whispering among themselves. The old factory director has mysteriously disappeared, the new factory director is eager to distance himself, and the guardian of the water source has become taciturn. An investigation into the secret of the water source has quietly begun. What is the truth? Is it to cover up the truth for profit, or is there another hidden story? Everything is hidden in the landscape of the Thousand Island Lake.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "changzheng",
        "name": "Zhang Zheng",
        "identity": "Nongfu Spring investigative reporter",
        "personality": "Sharp, persistent, pursues the truth",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "lili",
        "name": "Li Li",
        "identity": "Nongfu Spring quality inspector",
        "personality": "Cautious, upright, has a conscience",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "zhaosi",
        "name": "Zhao Si",
        "identity": "An old villager at the Nongfu Spring water source",
        "personality": "Simple, talkative, knows the inside story",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "wangbo",
        "name": "Wang Bo",
        "identity": "The new factory director of Nongfu Spring",
        "personality": "Slick, worldly, eager for success",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "Zhang Zheng and Li Li arrive at Thousand Island Lake and begin to investigate the water pollution incident separately. Zhang Zheng secretly interviews the old villager Zhao Si, trying to learn more about the secrets of the water source. Li Li looks for clues inside the factory, but finds that some quality inspection reports have been tampered with. Wang Bo does his best to stop Zhang Zheng and Li Li's investigation, claiming that everything is a rumor.",
        "privateClues": {
          "changzheng": "Zhao Si reveals that the old factory director went to the depths of the water source many times before he disappeared, as if he was looking for something. He mentioned a place called 'Stone Dragon Pool,' saying that it is the most mysterious area of the water source.",
          "lili": "You find that in the recent water sample test reports, the pH value has abnormal fluctuations, which is significantly different from the previous normal values. The tampering marks on this report are very obvious, as if someone did it on purpose."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Zhang Zheng goes to 'Stone Dragon Pool' to investigate and finds that the pool water is different from the normal water source quality, as if it has been polluted by some kind of mineral. Li Li discovers that the person who tampered with the report is Wang Bo's secretary. Wang Bo begins to distance himself from Li Li and intends to transfer her from the quality inspection department. Zhao Si becomes vigilant and is unwilling to reveal more information.",
        "privateClues": {
          "changzheng": "You find some abandoned mining equipment near Stone Dragon Pool. The equipment has a blurry mark on it, which seems to belong to a company called 'Jinshi Mining.' You speculate that the water pollution may be related to this company.",
          "lili": "You secretly copied a copy of the original water sample test data and found that the pollution source may be excessive heavy metals, but the specific type is not yet clear. You also found that Wang Bo had a secret meeting with the person in charge of 'Jinshi Mining.'"
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "Zhang Zheng finds out that 'Jinshi Mining' has a beneficial relationship with Wang Bo. The company's illegal mining has caused minerals to penetrate into the water source, polluting the water quality. Li Li decides to disclose the truth to the media, but is blocked by Wang Bo. Zhao Si finally reveals that the old factory director discovered the secret of 'Jinshi Mining' and was therefore framed and disappeared. In the end, the truth of the pollution incident is revealed.",
        "privateClues": {
          "changzheng": "You find evidence of illegal mining by 'Jinshi Mining' and learn that they have signed a secret agreement with Nongfu Spring, allowing them to mine minerals near the water source in exchange for financial support from Nongfu Spring. The agreement has Wang Bo's signature.",
          "lili": "You successfully sent the water sample test report and the photo of Wang Bo and the person in charge of 'Jinshi Mining' to the media anonymously. At the same time, you have also collected enough evidence to report Wang Bo's criminal behavior to the police."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754301218318,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754301360682_v48mss5xo",
    "title": "The Kiwi Fruit Dispute",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "In a sunny orchard, the annual 'Kiwi King' competition is about to begin. The prize of the competition is the rarest 'Golden Kiwi' in the orchard, which is said to make people stay young and healthy forever. The old orchard owner has announced his retirement, and whoever wins this competition will have the opportunity to take over the entire orchard. However, behind the seemingly fair competition, there are undercurrents. The competitors have long had their own ulterior motives, and in order to win the competition, they are not afraid to use various means. Friendship, love, and interests are all shaky in the face of this small kiwi fruit.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "kiwiKing",
        "name": "Li Dali",
        "identity": "The son of the old orchard owner, and one of the heirs to the orchard",
        "personality": "Honest and simple, down-to-earth and hardworking, has a deep love for the orchard, but lacks competition experience.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "kiwiQueen",
        "name": "Zhao Xiaomei",
        "identity": "The daughter of the owner of the neighboring orchard, and Li Dali's childhood sweetheart",
        "personality": "Smart and clever, good at socializing, has unique insights into the cultivation and sales of kiwi fruit, but has to compete with Li Dali for the benefit of her family.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "uncleWang",
        "name": "Uncle Wang",
        "identity": "An old employee of the orchard, who has witnessed the rise and fall of the orchard",
        "personality": "Taciturn, experienced, knows everything about the orchard.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "auntZhang",
        "name": "Aunt Zhang",
        "identity": "The cook in the orchard canteen, enthusiastic and hospitable, a well-informed gossip",
        "personality": "Enthusiastic and cheerful, helpful, but also a complete gossip lover.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins. The first round is a speed race to see who can eat the specified number of kiwi fruits in the shortest time. Li Dali and Zhao Xiaomei are both going all out. Uncle Wang watches silently from the side, while Aunt Zhang is busy cheering for everyone. During the competition, Zhao Xiaomei seems to deliberately slow down, which arouses Li Dali's suspicion.",
        "privateClues": {
          "kiwiKing": "You notice that when Zhao Xiaomei is eating kiwi fruit, she seems to deliberately pick some smaller ones. She seems to be hiding something, which makes you very uneasy. You remember that she often deliberately lost to you when you were young to give you face.",
          "kiwiQueen": "You have learned a secret. The kiwi fruit from the neighboring orchard has been selling poorly recently. Your father hopes that you will win the competition and take this opportunity to open up sales channels for the orchard. You see the hopeful look in Li Dali's eyes and feel a little guilty."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "The second round is a kiwi fruit knowledge quiz, with questions involving the cultivation, nutritional value, and various related historical allusions of kiwi fruit. Li Dali and Zhao Xiaomei help each other during the quiz, and the atmosphere is harmonious. But when asked about the legend of the 'Golden Kiwi,' Uncle Wang suddenly becomes silent, as if he knows something.",
        "privateClues": {
          "kiwiKing": "You secretly hear Aunt Zhang muttering to Uncle Wang that the legend of the 'Golden Kiwi' is actually fake, and was made up to encourage everyone to grow kiwi fruit. But Uncle Wang doesn't seem to agree, his expression is very serious.",
          "kiwiQueen": "You accidentally discover that Uncle Wang is holding an old orchard log, which contains some clues about the 'Golden Kiwi,' but the handwriting is blurred and difficult to recognize. You can be sure that Uncle Wang knows more about the Golden Kiwi than you do."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The final round is a kiwi fruit creative cooking competition. Li Dali and Zhao Xiaomei need to use kiwi fruit as the main ingredient to create a delicious dish. During the process, Zhao Xiaomei accidentally knocks over Li Dali's ingredients, and the two have a dispute. Aunt Zhang tries to mediate, but with little effect. Uncle Wang walks alone to the depths of the orchard, as if looking for something.",
        "privateClues": {
          "kiwiKing": "You are very angry and think that Zhao Xiaomei deliberately sabotaged your competition to make you lose. You notice that her eyes are evasive, as if she is hiding something. You swear to find out the truth and expose her true colors. You see Uncle Wang walking towards the depths of the orchard, where is he going?",
          "kiwiQueen": "You are struggling internally, wanting to win the competition but not wanting to hurt Li Dali. Knocking over the ingredients was not your intention, but you do have the idea of using this competition to help your family. You see from a distance that Uncle Wang seems to be looking for something. Thinking of the log you saw before, you realize that the Golden Kiwi may really exist, and it is hidden in the orchard!"
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754301360682,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754301921228_pni5clcks",
    "title": "Sweet Conspiracy: The Cantaloupe Contest Saga",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "The annual 'Melon King Contest' is held as scheduled in Melon Town, which is rich in cantaloupes. In order to promote the cantaloupes of Melon Town, the town mayor has spent a lot of money to hold this competition, and promised that the champion will be awarded the title of 'Melon King' and 30% of the shares in the cantaloupe industry of Melon Town. The old-brand melon farmer 'Sweetheart Melon Garden' and the emerging force 'Honey Talk Orchard' are the hot favorites to win the championship. The two melon gardens are secretly competing for this competition. On the eve of the competition, it was rumored that the cantaloupes of 'Sweetheart Melon Garden' had been tampered with, making this competition confusing. Just as the competition is about to begin, everyone is eyeing each other, wanting to know who the final 'Melon King' will be.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "tianxin",
        "name": "Li Tiantian",
        "identity": "Heir to Sweetheart Melon Garden",
        "personality": "Shrewd and capable, competitive, but sometimes too impulsive",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "miyu",
        "name": "Zhao Miyu",
        "identity": "Founder of Honey Talk Orchard",
        "personality": "Calm and composed, good at observation, has a deep city",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "wangcai",
        "name": "Wang Wangcai",
        "identity": "The mayor of Melon Town",
        "personality": "Slick and worldly, profit-oriented, keen on power and money transactions",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "zhangsan",
        "name": "Zhang San",
        "identity": "Melon farmer, onlooker",
        "personality": "Honest and simple, well-informed, likes to gossip",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins! The host announces the rules: each person has a carefully selected cantaloupe in front of them, and the one who finishes eating it in the shortest time and raises their hand wins. Li Tiantian and Zhao Miyu quickly get into the zone and start eating. Mayor Wang Wangcai watches with a smile, talking to others from time to time. Zhang San is inquiring about something in the crowd.",
        "privateClues": {
          "tianxin": "Last night you saw a suspicious figure in your melon garden, who seemed to be from Zhao Miyu's orchard. You suspect they tampered with your cantaloupes, but you have no evidence. You secretly took a bite of your own melon and found that it tasted a bit bitter.",
          "miyu": "You bribed Mayor Wang Wangcai in advance and promised to give him a share of the profits after the competition. You learned that a batch of melons in Li Tiantian's melon garden was infected with pests and diseases, but she concealed it. You are prepared to expose her at the right time.",
          "wangcai": "(AI) Last night Zhao Miyu secretly sent a box of valuable gifts and hinted that she hoped you would 'take care' of her in the competition. You agreed and secretly adjusted the quality of Li Tiantian's melon, but you have to pretend to be fair and just on the surface.",
          "zhangsan": "(AI) I heard someone say that there seems to be a problem with the melons in Li Tiantian's melon garden, but I don't know what the specific problem is. It seems to be related to pests and diseases. I also saw Mayor Wang secretly talking to Zhao Miyu."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Li Tiantian is the first to raise her hand to signal that she has finished, but she suddenly clutches her stomach and her face turns pale. Zhao Miyu takes the opportunity to speed up and also raises her hand to signal that she has finished. Mayor Wang Wangcai declares Zhao Miyu the winner, but the audience is talking about Li Tiantian's condition. Zhang San takes the opportunity to spread the news that the cantaloupes in Li Tiantian's melon garden may be infected with pests and diseases.",
        "privateClues": {
          "tianxin": "Your stomach hurts more and more, and you suspect that the melon was drugged. You remember that yesterday you saw Zhao Miyu's assistant sneak into your melon garden. You need to find evidence to prove that Zhao Miyu framed you.",
          "miyu": "You successfully won the competition, but Li Tiantian's reaction makes you a little uneasy. You are worried that she will discover what you did. You must consolidate your victory as soon as possible and let Wang Wangcai help you suppress public opinion.",
          "wangcai": "(AI) You see that Li Tiantian is not in a good condition, and you feel a little guilty. You are worried that the matter will be exposed and affect your reputation. You decide to stabilize the situation first, appease the emotions of the masses, and find an opportunity to discuss countermeasures with Zhao Miyu.",
          "zhangsan": "(AI) Li Tiantian's current situation further confirms my guess, her melon must have a problem! And I saw Mayor Wang Wangcai secretly winking at Zhao Miyu, they must be up to something."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "Li Tiantian endures the severe pain and accuses Zhao Miyu of drugging her melon. Zhao Miyu flatly denies it and bites back, accusing Li Tiantian of concealing the pest and disease in her melon garden. Seeing this, Mayor Wang Wangcai announces a suspension of the competition and requests that the cantaloupes of both parties be tested. Zhang San fans the flames on the side, demanding a thorough investigation of the matter.",
        "privateClues": {
          "tianxin": "You must produce evidence to prove Zhao Miyu's crime. You think of a way. You can secretly take away the remaining cantaloupe residue from Zhao Miyu and hand it over to a reliable testing agency for testing to find evidence of her poisoning.",
          "miyu": "The current situation is very unfavorable for you. You must destroy the evidence as soon as possible and let Mayor Wang Wangcai come forward to clarify for you. At the same time, you must also prepare in advance to deal with Li Tiantian's accusations.",
          "wangcai": "(AI) Things have gotten out of your control. To protect yourself, you must make a choice, whether to continue to stand on Zhao Miyu's side, or to turn to Li Tiantian to save yourself? The best way now is to delay time and wait for the test results to come out.",
          "zhangsan": "(AI) This matter is getting more and more interesting! I must find out the truth. I saw Li Tiantian secretly take away the remaining melon from Zhao Miyu. It seems she is going to find evidence. I have to keep a close eye on her movements!"
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754301921228,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754302440092_nnyy5jm8e",
    "title": "Lemon's Lament",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "The annual 'Sour Challenge' is held as scheduled in Lemon Town. The town's residents are famous for producing high-quality lemons, but their attitude towards lemons is very complicated. They both rely on it for wealth and fear its sourness. For this year's challenge, in order to increase the watchability and prize money of the competition, the town mayor specially selected Emilia and Old John, who have never participated in the competition before. Emilia is the owner of a newly opened coffee shop in the town, and Old John is an old gardener in a lemon plantation. Both have unknown secrets about lemons. The seemingly simple lemon-eating contest is actually full of undercurrents, hiding choices about the past and future of Lemon Town.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "emilia",
        "name": "Emilia Rose",
        "identity": "Coffee shop owner",
        "personality": "Calm, decisive, gentle on the outside but strong on the inside",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "john",
        "name": "John Miller",
        "identity": "Old gardener",
        "personality": "Taciturn, experienced, seems to hide many secrets",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "mayor",
        "name": "Richard Green",
        "identity": "The mayor of Lemon Town",
        "personality": "Slick and worldly, values interests, slightly hypocritical",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "martha",
        "name": "Martha Brown",
        "identity": "A resident of the town",
        "personality": "Gossipy, curious, well-informed",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins. The first round is a timed lemon-eating contest to see who can eat the most lemons in the allotted time. Although Emilia is fast, she seems to be not used to the sour taste, and her expression is a bit painful. Old John, on the other hand, seems very calm, as if he is not eating lemons, but just ordinary fruit. The mayor is giving an inspiring speech on the stage, while Martha is whispering to other residents offstage, talking about the two contestants.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emilia": "You smell a faint lemon blossom scent on Old John, which is slightly different from the ordinary lemon scent. You remember that when you were a child, your grandmother used lemon blossom oil to treat your stomach problems, but the effect was not good. You have always been sensitive to the smell of lemon blossoms.",
          "john": "You notice that when Emilia is eating lemons, her eyes will occasionally look at the mayor, as if looking for his reaction. You remember that the mayor worked in your father's lemon grove when he was young, but was fired for stealing lemons."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "The second round is a lemon juice competition, where contestants need to squeeze the most lemon juice in the shortest time. Emilia uses the tools from her coffee shop and is very efficient, far ahead. Old John seems to be struggling a bit, but the color of the lemon juice he squeezes seems to be darker than Emilia's. The mayor announces a halftime break. Martha runs over to ask Emilia if she has any grudges against Old John, because Old John has been asking about your coffee shop recently.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emilia": "Martha tells you that Old John has been asking others if the lemons used in your coffee shop are from local sources. And to ensure quality, your shop has always imported lemons from other places. You are worried that Old John will use this to make an issue and affect your business.",
          "john": "You notice a piece of paper sticking out of the mayor's suit pocket, which says 'Control Emilia, the reward will be doubled after the matter is done.' You vaguely feel that there is an ulterior secret behind this competition, and Emilia is likely being used by the mayor."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The third and final round requires contestants to carve lemon peels into exquisite works of art. Emilia carves a lifelike lemon blossom, which wins applause from the audience. Old John, however, suddenly gives up carving, walks up to the mayor, and accuses him of using the lemon competition to cover up the illegal smuggling of lemons. The scene is in an uproar, and Martha excitedly takes out her phone to record.",
        "privateClues": {
          "emilia": "You suddenly remember that before your grandmother died, she told you that lemon blossom oil can cure a rare poison, and this poison is only contained in a mutated lemon unique to Lemon Town. You realize that the lemon blossom scent Old John gave you before was problematic, and the mayor is likely involved.",
          "john": "You can see from the mayor's expression that he is guilty. You tell Emilia that the mayor has been secretly selling the town's mutated lemons to foreign pharmaceutical companies at a high price, and this mutated lemon is highly toxic and long-term consumption will lead to serious diseases."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754302440092,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754302869153_qs6rfp7oe",
    "title": "The Melon Seed King Contest: The Lost Recipe for Fried Goods",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "The annual 'Melon Seed King Contest' is held as scheduled in the ancient town of Lin'an. This competition is not only to compete for the title of 'Melon Seed King,' but also about the ownership of the ancestral secret recipe for fried goods. Legend has it that the 'Fried Goods King,' Lu You, integrated his life's work into a unique secret recipe for fried goods, and stipulated that only the Melon Seed King could inherit it. Now, this secret recipe has unexpectedly disappeared, casting a shadow over this year's competition. The contestants must not only compete in the speed of eating melon seeds, but also search for the lost secret recipe and uncover the hidden secrets behind it.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "character1",
        "name": "Lu Xiaoman",
        "identity": "A descendant of Lu You, the owner of the fried goods shop 'You Ji Fried Goods,' and a popular contestant in this year's Melon Seed King Contest.",
        "personality": "Shrewd and capable, calm on the outside, but eager to revive the family's fried goods business. Carries the expectations of the family, under great pressure.",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "character2",
        "name": "Wang Dachui",
        "identity": "A veteran melon seed eater, a melon seed wholesaler, and a loyal audience member of the Melon Seed King Contest for three consecutive years.",
        "personality": "Optimistic, a gossip lover, well-informed, and knows all the big and small matters in Lin'an Town. Good at observing people's words and expressions.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character3",
        "name": "Li Cuihua",
        "identity": "A retired teacher, a melon seed lover, who participates in the Melon Seed King Contest every year, but has never won a prize.",
        "personality": "Cheerful and outgoing, hospitable, likes to share, but is sometimes too talkative. Has an unusual love for melon seeds.",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins, and Lu Xiaoman takes the lead with her skilled technique. Wang Dachui cheers for her loudly from the audience, and from time to time shares the melon seeds he brought with Li Cuihua next to him. However, Lu Xiaoman suddenly slows down while in the lead, as if she has discovered something unusual.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "You notice that the melon seeds used in the competition seem to be a different variety from the ones used in your own fried goods shop, and the taste is also slightly different. You suspect that someone has tampered with them, but you can't be sure for a while.",
          "character2": "You see Lu Xiaoman secretly observing Li Cuihua several times during the competition, as if she is suspicious of her. You feel that there must be a story behind this.",
          "character3": "While eating melon seeds, you notice a faint herbal smell on the melon seed shells, which reminds you of the recipe that Old Mr. Lu, a descendant of Lu You, often used when you were young."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "Lu Xiaoman deliberately slows down to observe the reactions of the other contestants. Wang Dachui seems to be cheering for her enthusiastically, but he exchanges glances with Li Cuihua next to him from time to time. Halfway through the competition, someone suddenly reports that Lu Xiaoman is cheating, saying that she is using a special technique. The scene is in an uproar.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "You notice that Wang Dachui and Li Cuihua are exchanging glances frequently, and they seem to be deliberately hiding something. You recall seeing similar gestures in the old Lu family house when you were a child. At that time, Wang Dachui and Old Mr. Lu had a good relationship.",
          "character2": "You notice that Li Cuihua has been secretly observing Lu Xiaoman and seems to be looking for something. You accidentally hear her muttering 'secret recipe,' which makes you curious.",
          "character3": "You see Wang Dachui secretly stuffing a handful of melon seeds into Lu Xiaoman's pocket, and then pretending that nothing happened. This makes you think he is up to something, but you don't know what he wants to do."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "Under the questioning of the crowd, Lu Xiaoman is forced to undergo an inspection. As a result, melon seeds mixed with special herbs are found in her pocket. Lu Xiaoman is unable to defend herself and is in a predicament. At this time, Wang Dachui suddenly stands up and claims to know the truth. Li Cuihua also silently takes out an old secret recipe for fried goods.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "You find that the herbs in your pocket are very similar to one of the medicinal materials in the ancestral secret recipe, but the ratio is completely different. You realize that someone wants to use you to cover up the truth, and the real secret recipe is elsewhere.",
          "character2": "You admit that you secretly put the herbal melon seeds into Lu Xiaoman's pocket in order to draw out the secret recipe in Li Cuihua's hands. You have always suspected that Old Mr. Lu gave the secret recipe to her, and your real purpose is to get the secret recipe and carry it forward.",
          "character3": "The secret recipe in your hand is a fragment left by Lu You, and the key ratio is missing. You have been trying to find the complete secret recipe for many years, but you have never found any clues. Until today, you found that the herbal smell in Lu Xiaoman's melon seeds is very similar to what you smelled back then, but it is obviously not the same."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754302869153,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
  {
    "id": "script_1754302898488_ugh8a7mal",
    "title": "The Cracking King Contest",
    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "In Cracking Melon Seed Town, where cracking melon seeds is a cultural center, the annual 'Cracking King Contest' is the town's grandest festival. All kinds of melon seed cracking masters gather together to compete for the title of 'Cracking King' and the golden melon seed that symbolizes honor. However, this year's competition is shrouded in a shadow. It is said that the golden melon seed has been stolen, and the thief is hidden among the contestants. Who will win the competition, and who is the mastermind? The townspeople are eagerly waiting, and a tense atmosphere fills the air.",
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": "character1",
        "name": "Li Cuihua",
        "identity": "Melon seed stall owner, former Cracking King",
        "personality": "Spicy and straightforward, confident, competitive, has a special affection for the golden melon seed",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "character2",
        "name": "Wang Dachui",
        "identity": "Novice melon seed cracking enthusiast, a tourist from out of town",
        "personality": "Honest and simple, curious, although his skills are average, he is determined to participate",
        "isMainCharacter": true
      },
      {
        "id": "character3",
        "name": "Zhang San",
        "identity": "Cracking Melon Seed Contest judge",
        "personality": "Serious, meticulous, fair and selfless",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      },
      {
        "id": "character4",
        "name": "Zhao Liu",
        "identity": "The mayor of Cracking Melon Seed Town",
        "personality": "Slick and worldly, values fame and fortune, very concerned about the competition results",
        "isMainCharacter": false
      }
    ],
    "roundContents": [
      {
        "round": 1,
        "plot": "The competition officially begins, and the contestants are eager to start. The first round is a speed competition. Whoever cracks the specified number of melon seeds in the shortest time can advance. Li Cuihua is as good as ever, with amazing speed. Although Wang Dachui is slow, he tries his best to keep up. The judge Zhang San seriously records the scores, and the mayor Zhao Liu patrols under the stage, as if looking for something.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "(Li Cuihua) You find that your melon seed bag is mixed with very poor quality melon seeds, which affects your speed. Upon closer inspection, you find that Wang Dachui touched your bag before you started.",
          "character2": "(Wang Dachui) You accidentally see the mayor Zhao Liu secretly hiding something under the judge Zhang San's table, as if he wants to influence the outcome of the competition."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 2,
        "plot": "The second round is a skill competition, which requires the contestants to crack the melon seeds while keeping the kernels intact. The one with the most intact kernels wins. Li Cuihua is experienced and at ease. Wang Dachui is clumsy, but with patience, he barely keeps up. When the judge Zhang San announces the rules of the competition, his eyes flicker, as if he has something to hide. Mayor Zhao Liu keeps staring at the competition and whispers to the judge from time to time.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "(Li Cuihua) You notice that Mayor Zhao Liu keeps winking at the judge Zhang San, implying that he should take care of Wang Dachui. You suspect that there is some kind of deal between them.",
          "character2": "(Wang Dachui) You notice a familiar melon seed bag on the judge Zhang San's table, which looks exactly like the one you accidentally lost yesterday, and there are fewer melon seeds inside."
        }
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "plot": "The final round is a creative competition, where contestants need to use the cracked melon seed shells to create a work of art. The one with the best work wins. Li Cuihua uses the melon seed shells to create a lifelike pattern of the golden melon seed. Wang Dachui, on the other hand, creates a map of Cracking Melon Seed Town, expressing his love for the town. Zhang San announces the scoring criteria, and Zhao Liu prepares to present the award. The winner is about to be announced.",
        "privateClues": {
          "character1": "(Li Cuihua) In Wang Dachui's work, you find a unique fragment from your melon seed stall. This fragment is from the box of your lost golden melon seed.",
          "character2": "(Wang Dachui) You suddenly remember seeing an empty golden melon seed box in Mayor Zhao Liu's room yesterday, and it was exactly the same as the lost box described by Li Cuihua."
        }
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": 1754302898488,
    "createdBy": "system"
  },
