    "rounds": 3,
    "background": "After the tragic battle with the Fire Tribe, Ka Suo lost almost all his relatives, including his beloved brother Ying Kong Shi. In order to resurrect his relatives, he embarked on a journey to find the hidden lotus. However, at the critical moment of finding the hidden lotus, Ka Suo finds himself trapped in a time loop maze. In each cycle, he returns to the eve of the ice and fire war, trying to change his destiny, but each result is ambiguous, full of unknown dangers and conspiracies. The undercurrents within the Ice Tribe, the unwillingness of the Fire Tribe to show weakness, and the mysterious forces hidden in the dark all make Ka Suo's road to resurrection extremely difficult. He must unravel the secrets hidden in the time loop to truly break free from the shackles of fate and save everything he cherishes. This time, he is closer to the truth than ever before, but also closer to the brink of death.",
